  "description": "meme-id: the_one_piece_of_shit_that_just_won_t_flush; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a hand pointing at a toilet flush handle with the text \"the one piece of shit that just won't flush!\". The scene is a common, relatable frustration about a clogged toilet. The overall intent is to humorously express annoyance at a persistent plumbing problem. The text uses vulgar language ('piece of shit') to emphasize the frustration, but this is directed at an inanimate object (the toilet), not a person or group. Therefore, it does not contain abusive, cyberbullying, hateful, misogynistic, or propagandistic content. The toxicity level is low, as the insult is directed at a mundane object, not a protected characteristic or individual. The meme's intent is to create relatable humor through the juxtaposition of the visual (pointing at the flush handle) and the text (vulgar complaint), evoking shared experiences of household frustrations without targeting any group or individual.",
